modal='''\n<section class="panel modal moderation-modal" id="moderationModal">\n  <div class="panel-inner">\n    <div class="panel-head"><div><span>OWNER MODERATION</span><h2 id="moderationTitle">Reset a spot.</h2></div><button class="close" data-close>×</button></div>\n    <div class="moderation-policy"><b>USE THIS RARELY.</b><p>TAKEOVER is intentionally permissive. Do not reset a spot because it is ugly, weird, provocative, annoying, competitive, or unpopular. Reset only for an extreme fraud, security, legal, rights, or safety problem.</p></div>\n    <div class="field"><label>WHY ARE YOU RESETTING IT?</label><select id="moderationReason"><option value="">Choose an extreme reason</option><option value="fraud_or_scam">Fraud or scam</option><option value="malware_or_phishing">Malware / phishing / malicious redirect</option><option value="illegal_or_dangerous">Illegal or clearly dangerous activity</option><option value="impersonation_or_rights">Impersonation / serious rights abuse</option><option value="credible_safety_or_legal_risk">Credible safety or legal risk</option><option value="other_extreme_issue">Other comparably extreme issue</option></select></div>\n    <div class="field"><label>PRIVATE NOTE · OPTIONAL</label><textarea id="moderationNote" maxlength="500" placeholder="Short internal note. Required only if you choose Other."></textarea></div>\n    <p class="hint">Resetting returns the spot to available and resets its takeover price. It does not automatically refund the advertiser. The action is privately logged.</p>\n    <button class="action danger" id="confirmResetSpot">RESET SPOT TO AVAILABLE</button>\n    <button class="secondary" id="moderationCancel">KEEP THE SPOT</button>\n  </div>\n</section>\n'''
